Attacking any priest or priestess (aligned or not) is not a very good idea, 
unless you have a very strong chracter and pissing off your god does not matter.
I am not sure if this applies to Chaotics. The priest/priestess are generally
pretty strong and the god comes to their aid by summoning all kinds of
creatures. A ring of conflict would be great. Also you would need good AC and
magic resistance.
I once prayed continuously to see how far the god would go. You could lose 
exp.levels, get struck by lightning, reduce luck. The character I had was
pretty strong (Lvl. 25 Valkyrie, AC -30, lots of intrinsics, grey dragon scale
mail, +8 Excal. etc.). The only thing that really hurt was losing exp. The 
lightning did not affect me. Try it in the debug mode. You get some pretty 
interesting messages.
If you are not that strong, it is a good idea to dropscrolls, potions and wands
before trying something like that. Ditto, when fighting monsters with breath
weapons. A red dragon could burn up all your scrolls and potions.

