***Minor  Spoiler***

One way to kill(well, not really) all the nasties in the castle, is to go in 
the backway, over the trapdoors and then back off. When the nasties follow you
they fall in through the trap doors into the next level (hell). 


This might have happened to you. You don't gain any stuff by facing them in 
front. The soldiers in the first room of the castle can give you rings of
protection(you have to kill them first!). 

> 
>    Can I get fire resistance from things other than
>    rings ?  What if I find only a cursed ring of 
>    fire resistance ?  How can I remov curse ? 
>    Dip them in a fountain ?  
> 

To get fire resistance eat corpses of monsters which have intrinsic fire
resistance. You may not get it at the first try, but persistance pays. The
monsters could be red dragons, fire ants, red molds, gelatinous cubes. There
are probably a few more.
Red dragons are your best bet. I have almost always encountered one before the
castle level. If you haven't then stick around in the previous levels for some
time and sooner or later you'll meet one.

